      "text": "⚡️🇵🇸 Thousands of Palestinians gathered in Gaza City today for a mass funeral honoring 112 members of the Hassayna and Abu Sharia families, whose remains were recovered from beneath the rubble nearly three years after an \"israeli\" airstrike.\n\nCivil defence teams spent two weeks recovering the bodies from the destroyed residential building in the Sabra neighborhood, including the remains of at least 40 children. The victims were killed when their homes were struck in November 2023.\n\nThe funeral was one of the largest seen in Gaza since the war began, as families renewed calls for accountability and for the recovery of thousands still believed to be buried beneath the rubble.\n\n@medmannews",
